class:: MIRaGUI
summary:: Graphical visualizers and file inspection toolkit for MIRa
categories:: GUI>MIR, Libraries>MIR
related:: Classes/MIRaPlot, Classes/MIRaColormap, Classes/MIRaFileAnalyzer, Guides/MIRa-file-visualization, Guides/MIRa

description::
MIRaGUI provides a comprehensive suite of real-time monitoring views and whole-audio-file visual inspection tools for Music Information Retrieval in SuperCollider.

It includes 10 real-time reactive visualizers connected via control buses, alongside convenient front-end launchers for whole-file plots and the interactive multi-tier file inspector (link::Classes/MIRaPlot::).

classmethods::

subsection:: File Visualization & Inspection

method:: plotFile
Launches the synchronized multi-tier MIR File Inspector with audio scrubbing, colormap options, and playback. Shortcut for link::Classes/MIRaPlot#*dashboard::.
argument:: audioPath
Path to the audio file or sound name in code::sounds/::.
argument:: colormap
Colormap symbol (default: code::\magma::).
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.
returns:: A link::Classes/Window::.

method:: waveshow
Displays a standalone waveform with detected onsets and RMS envelope. Shortcut for link::Classes/MIRaPlot#*waveshow::.
argument:: audioPath
Path to the audio file.
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.
returns:: A link::Classes/Window::.

method:: spectrogram
Displays a 2D Constant-Q spectrogram with dB scaling, ticks, and colorbar. Shortcut for link::Classes/MIRaPlot#*spectrogram::.
argument:: audioPath
Path to the audio file.
argument:: colormap
Colormap symbol.
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.
returns:: A link::Classes/Window::.

method:: chromagram
Displays a 12-pitch-class chromagram (HPCP). Shortcut for link::Classes/MIRaPlot#*chromagram::.
argument:: audioPath
Path to the audio file.
argument:: colormap
Colormap symbol.
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.
returns:: A link::Classes/Window::.

method:: pitch
Displays extracted fundamental frequency on a MIDI note grid. Shortcut for link::Classes/MIRaPlot#*pitch::.
argument:: audioPath
Path to the audio file.
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.
returns:: A link::Classes/Window::.

method:: soundPath
Resolves a filename located in MIRa's code::sounds/:: corpus across installed and local extension paths.
argument:: filename
String filename (e.g. code::"melody.wav"::, code::"drums.wav"::, code::"piano-chords.wav"::).
returns:: An absolute file path string or nil.

subsection:: Real-Time Stream Visualizers

method:: scope
Real-time scrolling scalar oscilloscope with min/max bounds and engineering units.
argument:: name
String title.
argument:: bus
A control link::Classes/Bus::.
argument:: minVal
Minimum value for vertical axis.
argument:: maxVal
Maximum value for vertical axis.
argument:: units
String engineering units label (e.g. code::"Hz"::, code::"dB"::).
argument:: width
Window width.
argument:: height
Window height.

